---
description: Show the SRO agent roster and when to use each one
---
List the SRO agents and what each is for:

    @sro          engagement state, scope, policy, routing
    @researcher   hypotheses — never confirms anything
    @recon        attack-surface mapping
    @web          web application investigation
    @api          API, auth, authz, business logic
    @cloud        cloud configuration and IAM
    @ad           directory security, labs and internal
    @code         source and static analysis
    @verifier     independent validation
    @reporter     evidence-based report writing

Then tell me which one fits what I described, and why. If my request needs a target that is
not confirmed in scope, say so before dispatching anything.
